#
# Resource estimate for the 16k full-band FFT with yosys' experimental Gowin GW5A flow
# (synthesis only, no place-and-route; Gowin EDA Standard gives the real numbers).
# yosys does not map multipliers to GW5A DSP blocks, so fft_mul is kept as a black box: each
# fft_mul instance in the statistics is one 27x18 DSP multiplier. Run from the repository root:
#   yosys -s sim/fft/yosys_gw5a.ys | tail -40      (about 4 minutes)
read_verilog -lib rtl/fft/fft_mul.v
read_verilog rtl/fft/fft_delay.v rtl/fft/fft_bf.v rtl/fft/fft_twmul.v rtl/fft/fft_r22sdf.v
chparam -set LOG_N 14 -set IW 15 -set REAL_IN 1 fft_r22sdf
synth_gowin -family gw5a -top fft_r22sdf -noiopads
stat
